; CLI integration was previously tested via dune's cram stanza
; (see archived tests/cram/*.t). Cram's bwrap sandbox in dune 3.23
; does not expose _build/default/bin/mathc.exe to the test
; process despite (deps ../bin/mathc.exe), and CRAM_NO_BWRAP=1
; does not help — the sandbox still resolves /home/... paths
; against the sandbox FS, where the binary is masked.
;
; Shell fixtures under tests/fixtures/cli-*.sh provide the same
; CLI coverage via direct invocation through `nix develop .#test`.
; They run reliably in any dune version and have full access to
; the project tree. Migrate new CLI tests there.
;
; For the rationale and the documented cram sandbox limitation,
; see OCAML_BEST_PRACTICES §11.22 (was §11.20, retired).
